#: ../../chapter5.rst:3
msgid "Initial login"
msgstr "Eerste aanmelding"

#: ../../chapter5.rst:5
msgid "To get started, point your web browser at the |prodname| server."
msgstr "Om te beginnen, richt uw webbrowser op de |prodname| server."

#: ../../chapter5.rst:7
msgid ""
"If you are the system administrator for the |prodname| server and you are"
" in the server's console, you can point your web browser at "
"http://localhost"
msgstr "Als u de systeembeheerder bent voor de |prodname| server en u zich in de console van de server bevindt, kunt u uw webbrowser richten op http://localhost"

#: ../../chapter5.rst:11
msgid ""
"If you are in the Local Area Network, you can point your web browser at "
"the IP address of the |prodname| server - http://<ip-address>"
msgstr "Als u zich in het lokale netwerk bevindt, kunt u uw webbrowser richten op het IP-adres van de |prodname| server - http://<ip-adres>"

#: ../../chapter5.rst:14
msgid ""
"Most common, and in production,  you will be pointing your web browser at"
" the |prodname| server's DNS name, such as https://<DNS-Name-Of-Server>"
msgstr "Het meest voorkomend, en in productie, zult u uw webbrowser richten op de DNS-naam van de |prodname| server, zoals https://<DNS-Name-Of-Server>"

#: ../../chapter5.rst:17
msgid "Once you are in the web portal, you will be seeing the login page first."
msgstr "Zodra u op het webportaal bent, ziet u eerst de inlogpagina."

#: ../../chapter5.rst:23
msgid "|prodname| LOGIN"
msgstr "|prodname| INLOGGEN"

